00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:17.410
Is that Black Adam is not in this movie,
The Rock Black.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.212
Adam is not in this movie.

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:22.815
And they've been hyping up a confrontation
between Shazam and Black Adam

00:06:22.815 --> 00:06:23.516
for so long.

00:06:23.516 --> 00:06:26.919
It's such a huge deal in the back story
