00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:41.127
We also get a couple

00:07:41.127 --> 00:07:43.896
really cool scenes of them
using their powers together as a family.

00:07:44.163 --> 00:07:46.899
And because they did reveal the big Wonder
Woman cameo scene,

00:07:46.899 --> 00:07:48.668
I feel like it's
not too much to talk about that.

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:50.503
It didn't completely sideline the movie.

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:54.974
It is a relatively small beat, but
it is a pretty critical part of the film.

00:07:55.408 --> 00:08:00.513
It did feel a little bit like the Henry
Cavill Superman cameo scene in Black Adam,

00:08:00.513 --> 00:08:03.749
where he just kind of shows up at the end
very briefly for a couple of seconds

00:08:03.749 --> 00:08:05.718
and that's it. Like,
okay, we're going to do this.

00:08:05.718 --> 00:08:08.221
We're paying off a Big Joe from early
in the movie about Wonder Woman.

00:08:08.554 --> 00:08:10.056
If they were going to have her
in the movie,

00:08:10.056 --> 00:08:11.190
it would have been cooler to have her

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:14.560
