like do a bigger crossover.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:17.096
But I can understand why they wanted
the movie to feel self-contained

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:20.266
because of all this big craziness with DC,
all the big reboots,

00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:22.768
