00:08:24.637 --> 00:08:27.306
because they've already run
into that problem with the Flash movie.

00:08:27.306 --> 00:08:30.243
They filmed a bunch of Superman
cameo scenes with Henry Cavill.

00:08:30.243 --> 00:08:30.810
Superman.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.178
They had to remove those after the fact

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:35.314
because apparently they were setting up
a lot of future stuff that James Gunn

00:08:35.314 --> 00:08:39.519
is no longer planning on paying off
with his new ten year plan for DC movies.

00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:41.687
So it's like saying, Oh,
we had a bunch of cool stuff

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:44.156
that we might have been able to do
and Shazam Fury of the Gods,

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:46.759
but we're not going to do that
just to avoid future headaches.

00:08:47.093 --> 00:08:49.562
But if you do like smaller,
self-contained movies

00:08:49.562 --> 00:08:52.832
that don't connect to every single thing
and set up a bunch of other movies,

00:08:52.899 --> 00:08:55.101
