00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.709
with a bunch of new characters
and it won't cause a bunch of confusion.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.278
But they also end on a moment

00:09:05.278 --> 00:09:07.580
that will allow the characters
to continue in the future.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.782
If they do get to come back.

00:09:09.782 --> 00:09:10.082
The way

00:09:10.082 --> 00:09:12.051
that Zachary Levi has talked about,
that is it

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:13.819
just depends on the box office
for the movie.

00:09:13.819 --> 00:09:16.322
If it's incredibly successful,
like if it does well,

00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:18.124
