AM They even did that with the Merry
Marvel character during this movie

00:09:58.197 --> 00:10:01.000
where they actually have the actors
playing both versions of the character,

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.303
just because you got a little bit older
and it felt more natural for the character

00:10:04.303 --> 00:10:05.304
to do that.

00:10:05.304 --> 00:10:07.873
If that were the case,
then Asher Angel would have to start

00:10:07.873 --> 00:10:10.743
playing the Shazam
powered up version of the character.

00:10:10.977 --> 00:10:13.980
My only other complaint about the movie,
and this is actually similar

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:17.350
during the first movie is that it
almost feels like Asher Angel

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:21.120
